I come out of the office.
It is very dark outside.
Suddenly, the rain starts.
Big raindrops fall down.
Very quickly, the rain becomes strong.
Now it is raining heavily.
I take my umbrella from the bag.
I quickly open the umbrella.
Then a strong wind blows.
My umbrella moves in the wind.
The rain and wind are very strong.
Now there is loud thunder too.
It is very difficult to walk forward.
Rainwater falls on my body.
My clothes are getting wet.
I am walking very slowly.
The rain will increase even more.
This umbrella will not be enough here.
I will call an auto.
